  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You make great use of openings when you fight as a team. When you are adjacent to an ally, when you or the ally makes a successful Strike or spell attack against the creature, the other gains a +1 circumstance bonus to their next Strike or spell attack against that same creature. In addition, when you take this feat, for the purpose of any loupain ancestry feats including this one you are considered adjacent to an ally if you are within 15 feet of them.</span></p>"
